  riemann-at-home recheck --nanoda|--con-leche   Level 3 (optional): re-check the export with an independent checker
  riemann-at-home sign                     sign the joint statement (Level 2 or 3 only; shows the text first)

Standard library only. Run with `python3 -I`. Contract: CONTRACT.md (format rah/build/1).
